<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Northern Telecom started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Northern Telecom started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- J.P. Morgan said it started coverage of Northern Telecom Ltd with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose C$0.70 to C$71.75 on Friday on the Toronto Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>-- It rose 5/8 to 52-3/8 on the NYSE.  </p>
<p>-- Analyst Gregory Geiling said in a statement he expects the stock to achieve compound annual revenue growth of 33 percent in wireless, 20 percent in broadband and 18 percent in enterprise networks during the next three years.</p>
<p>-- The stock was given a 12-month price target of $63.</p>
</text>
